# Where this app differs from the scaffold

The scaffold (docs/work/scaffold.md) is the default. List here every deliberate difference, and why, so that
`/scaffold-update` keeps it and `doctor` accepts it:

- **Options** (`.copier-answers.yml`): which ones are off, and why.
- **Opted-out files** (`opt_out`): each path, and why. `doctor` fails on an opted-out path not named here.
- **Changed template-managed files**: what this app changed in them, and why. `copier update` keeps the change;
  a conflict means the scaffold changed the same lines, and this list says which side to keep.

